            "backendName": "datasetId",
            "description_en": "The corresponding dataset ID",
            "description_zh": "对应数据集ID",
            "example": "dataworks-datasetVersion:0gfxxxjx155usz3hrv",
            "title": "对应数据集ID",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Id": {
            "backendName": "id",
            "description_en": "The dataset version ID",
            "description_zh": "数据集版本ID",
            "example": "dataworks-datasetVersion:0gfxxxjx155usz3hrv:1",
            "title": "数据集版本ID",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "ImportInfo": {
            "additionalProperties": {
              "description_en": "The storage import configuration for the dataset",
              "description_zh": "数据集的存储导入配置信息",
              "example": "None",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "backendName": "importInfo",
            "description_en": "The storage import configuration for the dataset; required configuration varies by storage type.\n\nNAS\n\nRefer to the return values from the file storage API DescribeFileSystems.\n\n```JSON\n{\n\"fileSystemId\": \"3b6XXX89c9\", // The file system ID.\n\"fileSystemStorageType\":  \"Performance\" // The file system storage type.\n\"vpcId\": \"vpc-uf66oxxxrqge1t2gson7s\" // The VPC ID of the mount point.\n}\n```",
            "description_zh": "数据集的存储导入配置, 对于不同存储类型，需要的配置信息不同\n<details>\n<summary>NAS</summary>\n取值可参考文件存储 API DescribeFileSystems 的返回信息\n\n```JSON\n{\n  \"fileSystemId\": \"3b6XXX89c9\", // 文件系统ID\n  \"fileSystemStorageType\": \"Performance\", // 文件系统的存储规格\n  \"vpcId\": \"vpc-uf66oxxxrqge1t2gson7s\" // 挂载点的VPC ID\n}\n```\n\n</details>",
            "title": "数据集的存储导入配置\n对于NAS类型，需要提供以下属性，取值可参考DescribeFileSystems接口的返回信息\n- fileSystemId 文件系统ID\n- fileSystemStorageType 文件系统的存储规格\n- vpcId 挂载点的 VPC ID",
            "type": "object"
          },
          "Labels": {
            "backendName": "labels",
            "description_en": "The PAI dataset label",
            "description_zh": "PAI数据集标签",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DatasetLabel",
              "description_en": "The PAI dataset label",
              "description_zh": "PAI数据集标签"
            },
            "title": "PAI数据集标签",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "ModifyTime": {
            "backendName": "modifyTime",
            "description_en": "Modification time (milliseconds)",
            "description_zh": "修改时间毫秒级时间戳",
            "example": "1736756055000",
            "format": "int64",
            "title": "修改时间毫秒级时间戳",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "MountPath": {
            "backendName": "mountPath",
            "description_en": "The mount path. Defaults to /mnt/data",
            "description_zh": "挂载路径，默认为 /mnt/data",
            "example": "/mnt/data",
            "title": "挂载路径，默认为 /mnt/data",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "StorageType": {
            "backendName": "storageType",
            "description_en": "Storage type (read-only); consistent with the corresponding property of the parent dataset",
            "description_zh": "存储类型，只读，与所属数据集对应属性保持一致",
            "example": "OSS",
            "title": "存储类型，只读，与所属数据集对应属性保持一致",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "Url": {
            "backendName": "url",
            "description_en": "URL",
            "description_zh": "URL地址",
            "example": "oss://test-oss-bucket/test_dir/",
            "title": "URL地址",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "VersionNumber": {
            "backendName": "versionNumber",
            "description_en": "The dataset version number",
            "description_zh": "数据集版本号",
            "example": "1",
            "format": "int32",
            "title": "数据集版本号",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "title": "数据集版本对象",
        "type": "object"
      }
    }
